# Case: Event-driven history and quick-panel rendering
# Mode: process
# Purpose: Exercise actual service events, content completions and recovery through stopped production renderers.
# Steps:
#   Start isolated unicd, render both production bindings, advance idle UI time, submit real history and await independent deadline recovery.
# Expected:
#   No idle heartbeat builds; async events and content appear without manual frames; recovery still runs.
# Forbidden:
#   Manual polling to deliver completions, future 200 ms frame requests, native OS claims or missing receipt.

acceptance desktopui event-wakeup
